WEBVTT

00:11:59.116 --> 00:12:02.036
Bob, you mentioned,
at the top of your talk,

00:12:02.076 --> 00:12:05.116
that you run this Harvard Study
of Adult Development

00:12:05.156 --> 00:12:08.316
and gave us sort of a snippet
of what that is.

00:12:08.636 --> 00:12:11.276
But could you tell us a little bit
more about the study,

00:12:11.316 --> 00:12:12.556
what does it track?

00:12:12.556 --> 00:12:15.196
Why did it start,
who’s in the study today?

00:12:15.916 --> 00:12:17.356
Robert Waldinger: Absolutely.

00:12:17.396 --> 00:12:20.396
The study started in 1938,

00:12:20.436 --> 00:12:22.516
and it started with two groups:

00:12:22.516 --> 00:12:25.676
a group of Harvard College undergrads,

00:12:25.676 --> 00:12:30.076
and it started with a group
of inner city boys